# RC-CMP-FABLE-CONSULT prototype gate on the lane fixtures (synthetic only)

## A. Controls (the gate must accept what L9 writes)
A1 baseline fixture, canonical bytes
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A2 registered null (j_per_token) on a J contrast
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
