A3 keyed lists in the other order (list order is content, still canonical)
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A4 v3 floor with arm gates and resolutions (attributes, not identities)
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A5 refused arm gate printed null on both sides (Opus Q6; the comparator's refusal is a ruling, not the gate's)
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=step11_unmapped_fill' fails={'floor_gate_j': 3} unbound=[('fill:gamma/contrasts/*/floor/arm_gates/*/floor_gate_j', 'row_disagrees'), ('fill:gamma/contrasts/*/floor/resolutions/*/floor_gate_j', 'row_disagrees')]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A6 a band's pack is a declared attribute (ATTRIBUTES), accepted by G2; no meter in this fixture so the comparator refuses
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=step11_unmapped_fill' fails={} unbound=[('disclosure:window_lines/alpha/machine_summary/central_band/lower', 'no_row'), ('disclosure:window_lines/alpha/machine_summary/central_band/pack', 'no_row'), ('disclosure:window_lines/alpha/machine_summary/central_band/upper', 'no_row')]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A7 floor_composition line with the registered absolute cell id
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH
A8 floor_composition line with the REGISTERED comparative spelling (extraction_spec.json): the gate accepts; the comparator's suffix parser (floor_kind) cannot resolve it
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=0 stderr='' fails={} unbound=[]
    expected gate accept: MISMATCH

## B. Round-3 witnesses (a wrong printed number passed the comparator with exit 0)
B1 Opus F1 / Q3c: floors swapped, each floor object naming the other contrast
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:gamma/contrasts/*/floor/contrast_id
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=identity_field_misplaced:fill:gamma/contrasts/*/floor/contrast_id' fails=identity_field_misplaced:fill:gamma/contrasts/*/floor/contrast_id unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B2 Sol 1: a decode primary_contrast line printing prefill's estimate, re-routed by a nested contrast_id
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=identity_field_misplaced:disclosure:contrasts/*/estimator/contrast_id' fails=identity_field_misplaced:disclosure:contrasts/*/estimator/contrast_id unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B3 Opus F2 / Sol 2: duplicate member, wrong value first, agreeing value last
    gate=REFUSED l9_output_duplicate_key:estimate
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=l9_output_duplicate_key:fill' fails=l9_output_duplicate_key:fill unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B4 Sol 2: duplicate member, agreeing value first, wrong value last (the comparator already refuses this one)
    gate=REFUSED l9_output_duplicate_key:estimate
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=l9_output_duplicate_key:fill' fails=l9_output_duplicate_key:fill unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B5 Sol 2: NaN erased by a later duplicate member
    gate=REFUSED l9_output_nonfinite:NaN
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=l9_output_nonfinite:fill' fails=l9_output_nonfinite:fill unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B6 a lone NaN (today read as null and flagged; the gate refuses at load)
    gate=REFUSED l9_output_nonfinite:NaN
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=l9_output_nonfinite:fill' fails=l9_output_nonfinite:fill unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK
B7 Sol 3: a typo'd cell_id that substring parsing still routes
    gate=REFUSED identity_field_misplaced:block_lines/*/record/cell_id
    comparator alone: exit=2 stderr='refused=routing_id_unregistered:disclosure:floors/*/cell_id' fails=routing_id_unregistered:disclosure:floors/*/cell_id unbound=[]
    expected gate refuse: OK

